# mp8 (pump trips on close) with U one tick... two ticks earlier on open only: the bottom-right flag is a redstone block; a lamp (4,-2,0) next to the cell it moves INTO lights when it lands on open (t10) but goes dark 4 gt after it leaves on close (t8 -> t12); observer (3,-2,0) watching the lamp -> dust (2,-2,0) on stone (2,-3,0) next to U: U at t12 open, t14 close
set 3 -1 0 minecraft:redstone_block
set 3 -2 0 minecraft:observer[facing=east,powered=false]
clear 3 -3 0
set 2 -3 0 minecraft:stone
set 2 -2 0 minecraft:redstone_wire[east=none,north=none,power=0,south=none,west=none]
set 4 -2 0 minecraft:redstone_lamp[lit=false]
